{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19208","headline":"和思黯忆南庄见示 · 刘禹锡","name":"和思黯忆南庄见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丞相新家伊水头，智囊心匠日增修。\n化成池沼无痕迹，奔走清波不自由。\n台上看山徐举酒，潭中见月慢回舟。\n从来天下推尤物，合属人间第一流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}